abstract: >-
  Research software, two English reports and computational/formal evidence for
  a deterministic two-player shared-pool Mahjong achievement game. Complete
  SAFE-state retrograde analysis and reverse replay classify the empty position
  as a second-player win; both algorithms share rules and indexing. Partial
  Lean certification, finite algorithm models and bounded implementation tests
  are included. The opening Lean theorem remains NOT_VERIFIED. Version 1 closes
  the maintainer's active research delivery; future updates are expected only
  for substantive new findings or necessary corrections.
